AB  - Supplementary data for the scoping review "Personality and Trust in LLM Agents: Dependency Evidence, an Empty Behavioural Over-Reliance Cell, and the Personality-Trust Calibration Framework" by Carson Conception Rodrigues and Simran Marian Rebello (Celabe). charting_dataset_supplementary.csv has one row per charted record: the 60 included empirical studies (22 on contemporary generative LLMs) and 2 construct-informing records, with sample, AI-system type, individual-difference measure, outcome measure, charted finding, effect size as reported, and charting confidence. supplementary_material_S1_dataset_S2_reference_log.pdf is the same dataset typeset for reading (S1) plus the reference verification log (S2). Version 2 of the CSV (10 October 2026) cites the published versions of four records first charted from preprints. Preprint of the review: https://doi.org/10.31234/osf.io/2mdu8_v1
